10
00:00:19,113 --> 00:00:22,183
(Howard:)Yeah, let him do it.

11
00:00:25,786 --> 00:00:27,386
(Sheldon:)Oh.

12
00:00:27,388 --> 00:00:28,758
(Sheldon:)Remember when we got this

13
00:00:28,756 --> 00:00:30,186
(Sheldon:)at Comic-Con?

14
00:00:30,190 --> 00:00:31,490
(Stuart:)Oh, yeah.

15
00:00:31,492 --> 00:00:34,492
(Leonard:)The Mr. Spock cuckoo clock.

16
00:00:34,495 --> 00:00:38,065
(Mr Spock Cuckoo Clock:)Live long and prosper.
Live long and prosper.

17
00:00:38,065 --> 00:00:39,835
(Mr Spock Cuckoo Clock:)Live long
and prosper.

18
00:00:39,833 --> 00:00:41,833
(Mr Spock Cuckoo Clock:)Live long and prosper.

19
00:00:41,835 --> 00:00:44,165
(Sheldon:)It's one of a kind.

20
00:00:44,171 --> 00:00:47,271
(Penny:)So if it breaks
there'd be none of it?

21
00:00:48,475 --> 00:00:49,605
(Sheldon:)Well, Leonard,

22
00:00:49,610 --> 00:00:51,440
(Sheldon:)you know, who should keep this?

23
00:00:51,445 --> 00:00:55,345
(Sheldon:)On the one hand, I love
Mr. Spock more than you do.

24
00:00:55,349 --> 00:00:58,619
(Sheldon:)On the other hand, I care more
about clocks than you do.

25
00:00:58,619 --> 00:01:00,149
(Leonard:)So you think you should keep it?

